          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>(From) the one who is grateful for his favor, Ibr\u0101h\u012bm b. Is\u1e25\u0101q</li>\n<li>al-\u1e24asan\u012b(?), may (I) be made his ransom. (To) Cairo, may she be guarded, God willing.</li></ol>\n",
